/thumb/6/62/103mof11eafcg4zrho9ib48l87klok7.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%9C%87%E8%8D%A1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/62/103mof11eafcg4zrho9ib48l87klok7.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%9C%87%E8%8D%A1.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/62/103mof11eafcg4zrho9ib48l87klok7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />警用套索\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（减益）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"禁锢\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">禁锢</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼攻击2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×援护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×援护</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"禁锢\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">禁锢</font></span></span>]的目标，额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晕眩\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">晕眩</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。可使用<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-2 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/40/2gfpcz0gruh7uvz5hjs6kohxsqy1j9d.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-2_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/40/2gfpcz0gruh7uvz5hjs6kohxsqy1j9d.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9A%8F%E5%86%9B%E5%8C%BB%E5%B8%88%E2%80%9C%E8%8B%A6%E8%8D%AF%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/随军医师“苦药”\"><img alt=\"头像 随军医师“苦药”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a4/7szm04oa0yebd5ua8203uwrlvih5rkj.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">随军医师“苦药”</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8